<title>USA: TABLE-Central Newspapers Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Central Newspapers Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		 $  0.87		  $  0.53</p>
<p> Oper net		  22,800		   14,100</p>
<p> Revs		     180,000		  153,000</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		 $  1.68		    $0.97</p>
<p> Oper net		  44,200		   25,900</p>
<p> Revs		     351,000		  301,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 operating net excludes pre-tax charge of $682,000 from cost associated with elimination of 26 jobs during the quarter.</p>
<p>1996 Q2 operating net excludes pre-tax charges of $1,855,000 from building impairment and work force reductions costs.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
